[26508,16.6,2012,51,113,24],[26509,16.8,2012,51,110,25],[26510,17.0,2012,49,106,25]],"links":[["Morrill County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/nebraska/morrill-county"],["ARC or PLC in Morrill County","/arc-plc/nebraska/morrill-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Morrill County record runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids, February to March came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years, and April to May in 29. The middle of the grids got 31% of normal in January to February 2026 and 71% in May to June 2026. Grid 25610 had its driest year in 2012 at 47% of normal.</p>"}
